WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.470
On a shared phone or computer? Here's how to forget people on that device, or leave the volunteer list.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:13.750
At the bottom of your volunteer page, tap Sign-ins and my data on this device.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.827
Everyone saved on this phone or computer is listed, each with their own Forget button.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:24.956
Forget removes just that person from this device. Nothing changes in the Hub.

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:31.590
Tap Yes to confirm, or Cancel. To get back in, use your code or your email address.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.857
On a shared or borrowed device, Forget everyone clears the whole family.

00:00:37.057 --> 00:00:39.233
Confirm with Yes, forget everyone.

00:00:39.433 --> 00:00:49.600
Signed in with Google? Signing in again brings everyone back. On a shared device, also tap Sign out of Google. It signs the browser out of Gmail too.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:54.781
Leave the volunteer list stops Hub emails about shifts and paperwork.

00:00:54.981 --> 00:00:59.633
Check who's leaving. Anyone still signed up for a shift has to cancel it first.

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:06.440
Pick a reason, and tap Leave the list. If you sign up for a shift later, you're added back automatically.

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:12.230
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
